      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Recreated scope\n• C1: Weekly Star Home — hero, Honor Roll, Collection/Rules, This Week/Last Week, 4 gifts, Gift Ranking, My Rank\n• C2: Gift Ranking Details — Gift/Supporter tabs, Top 1 rewards, countdown, reward rules, ranking list, My Rank\n• C3: Monthly Ranking · Top — monthly scoring, Top 1/Top 2/Top 3, 30-day rewards, podium\n• C4: Monthly Ranking · Scrolled — reward cards, top-three podium, ranking grid\n• C5: Glory Weekly Star — collection card, medal reward, unlock progress, countdown, 3 locked gifts",
      "originalText": "Recreated scope\n• C1: Weekly Star Home — hero, Honor Roll, Collection/Rules, This Week/Last Week, 4 gifts, Gift Ranking, My Rank\n• C2: Gift Ranking Details — Gift/Supporter tabs, Top 1 rewards, countdown, reward rules, ranking list, My Rank\n• C3: Monthly Ranking · Top — monthly scoring, Top 1/Top 2/Top 3, 30-day rewards, podium\n• C4: Monthly Ranking · Scrolled — reward cards, top-three podium, ranking grid\n• C5: Glory Weekly Star — collection card, medal reward, unlock progress, countdown, 3 locked gifts",
